@startuml
' UC14.3 - Cập nhật thông tin Course
autonumber "<b>0.</b> "
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor white
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor black
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor black
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam MaxMessageSize 200

' AS-IS evidence; paths are relative to the workspace root.
' UC: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_UseCase.docx, UC14.3 row.
' BR: docs/uml/docs/LearnUP_QuyTacNghiepVu.docx, BR-60/61/84/285/51/54/55.
' The requested DOCX files are under docs/uml/docs, not directly under docs.
' Both metadata revisions are 1; no identified business-spec release is matched to a snapshot.
' docs/source-of-truth is absent; docs/architecture/source-of-truth-migration-plan.md:184 supports ownership.
' UI: frontend/src/pages/instructor/course.edit.tsx:73 (canEdit), :92 (loadCourse),
' :148 (handleCoverChange), :169 (remove), :185 (handleSave), :287 (blocked screen).
' Route: frontend/src/router.tsx:357/:359/:378 (Instructor protection and edit page).
' Wrappers: frontend/src/services/course.service.ts:46/:94/:97 (upload, read, update).
' Transport: frontend/src/services/axios.customize.ts:47/:61/:64; frontend/src/config/env.ts:13.
' Development URL: frontend/.env.development:10 = http://localhost:8080.
' No local override env file was found; process VITE_COURSE_BACKEND_URL is unset.
' Gateway: gateway/api-gateway/src/main/resources/application.yml:2/:40-43.
' Bootstrap: services/course-service/src/main.ts:40-43 (api prefix, URI v1).
' Controller: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.controller.ts:44/:115/:125.
' Service: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.service.ts:534 (findDetail),
' :592 (uploadCover), :660 (updateCourse), :720 (post-commit readback).
' Repository: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/courses.repository.ts:279 (findDetail),
' :320/:329 (duration), :375 (createCourseCoverMediaFile), :404 (updateCourse).
' DTO: services/course-service/src/modules/courses/dto/update-course.dto.ts:18.
' Models: services/course-service/prisma/schema.prisma:31/:126/:187/:206.
' Prisma adapter: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/prisma/prisma.service.ts:10;
' services/course-service/.env:2 selects course_db; credentials are not included here.
' Storage: services/course-service/src/infrastructure/storage/storage.provider.ts:31;
' libraries/ts-storage/src/providers/cloudinary/cloudinary.provider.ts:31/:61/:91.
' File validation: libraries/ts-storage/src/validators/file.validator.ts:7; course-values.ts:19.
' All required Cloudinary settings are nonempty locally, without process overrides; validity is unverified.
' Outbox evidence: courses.repository.ts:494 and modules/outbox/outbox.service.ts (empty implementation).

actor Instructor
boundary "Edit Course Page" as Screen
participant ":ApiGateway" as Gateway
participant ":CoursesController" as Controller
participant ":CoursesService" as Service
participant ":CoursesRepository" as Repository
participant ":CloudinaryStorageProvider" as Storage
participant "Cloudinary" as Cloudinary
database "course_db" as CourseDB

' Precondition: authenticated Instructor and valid route Course ID; use verified development routing.
' The required form-loading GET below expands its normal preparation path, not a separate UC14.1 action.
' Load failures (403/404, transport/provider/DB error) stop before the form and show Course not found;
' their partial reads are summarized in the outer failed operand.
' JWT/internal-key middleware and token refresh are outside the main UC interaction.

activate Instructor
Instructor -> Screen: Open /instructor/courses/{courseId}/edit
activate Screen
Screen -> Gateway: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> Controller: GET /api/v1/courses/{courseId}\nTrusted user context
activate Controller
Controller -> Service: Load current Course details
activate Service
alt Course loaded successfully
  ' findDetail requires INSTRUCTOR and organizationId, then queries ownership.
  Service -> Repository: Load owned Course metadata
  activate Repository
  Repository -> CourseDB: Read Course by tenant and chain owner
  activate CourseDB
  CourseDB -->> Repository: Current Course and cover metadata
  deactivate CourseDB
  Repository -->> Service: Current Course
  deactivate Repository
  Service -> Service: Calculate estimated duration
  activate Service
  ' Verified subcalls getReadingSpeedWordsPerMinute and aggregate SQL are not expanded here.
  ' They read course_db only; missing/nonpositive reading speed returns null.
  deactivate Service
  opt Current cover is Ready and not released
    Service -> Storage: Build cover URL
    activate Storage
    Storage -->> Service: Cover URL
    deactivate Storage
  end
  Service -->> Controller: Current Course details
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK\nCurrent Course details
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Current Course details
  deactivate Gateway

  ' Actual canEdit predicate: status == Draft OR status == Rejected, without a Locked check.
  alt Edit status checked successfully
    Instructor -> Screen: Edit Course fields and optional cover
    Instructor -> Screen: Select Save Changes
    Screen -> Screen: Validate Course form
    activate Screen
    deactivate Screen

    alt Form validated successfully
      ' Keep current coverFileId, remove with null, or replace with the newly uploaded file ID.
      ' UI file selection accepts JPEG/PNG/WebP up to 5 MiB and creates a local preview only.
      opt New cover selected
        Screen -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/courses/cover\nSelected image
        activate Gateway
        Gateway -> Controller: POST /api/v1/courses/cover\nTrusted user context
        activate Controller
        Controller -> Service: Upload replacement cover
        activate Service

        ' Outcome-level alternative: successful trace expands validation/storage/metadata work.
        alt Cover uploaded successfully
          ' uploadCover checks INSTRUCTOR/organization and validates file through the storage provider.
          ' It has no courseId parameter, Course-status lookup or subscription quota check.
          Service -> Storage: Upload cover image
          activate Storage
          Storage -> Cloudinary: Upload image
          activate Cloudinary
          Cloudinary -->> Storage: Stored image
          deactivate Cloudinary
          Storage -->> Service: Stored image and URL
          deactivate Storage
          Service -> Repository: Save replacement cover metadata
          activate Repository
          Repository -> CourseDB: Insert Ready CourseCover metadata\nCurrent organization
          activate CourseDB
          CourseDB -->> Repository: Cover metadata
          deactivate CourseDB
          Repository -->> Service: Cover file ID
          deactivate Repository
        else Cover upload failed
          ' Role/context, missing/invalid file, provider or metadata persistence failures are grouped.
          ' Failed attempts do not imply successful storage or metadata writes.
          opt Image stored but metadata save failed
            Service -> Storage: Delete newly uploaded image
            activate Storage
            Storage -> Cloudinary: Delete image
            activate Cloudinary
            Cloudinary -->> Storage: Cleanup result or error
            deactivate Cloudinary
            Storage -->> Service: Cleanup result or error
            deactivate Storage
            ' Best-effort deletion preserves the original metadata persistence error.
          end
        end
        Service -->> Controller: Cover details or upload error
        deactivate Service
        Controller -->> Gateway: 201 Created or upload error
        deactivate Controller
        Gateway -->> Screen: Cover details or upload error
        deactivate Gateway
      end

      ' Ready means no new image OR upload returned response.data. A rejected upload cannot reach PUT.
      ' Absence of a replacement is valid; removal sends null without any storage DELETE.
      alt Cover prepared successfully
        Screen -> Gateway: PUT /api/v1/courses/{courseId}\nSeven editable fields
        activate Gateway
        Gateway -> Controller: PUT /api/v1/courses/{courseId}\nTrusted user context
        activate Controller
        Controller -> Service: Update Course information
        activate Service
        Service -> Service: Verify Instructor and normalize fields
        activate Service
        deactivate Service

        ' Successful operand expands the transaction; failed guard/write attempts are summarized below.
        alt Course updated successfully
          Service -> Repository: Save Course information
          activate Repository
          ' All work through the outbox insert below is one Prisma transaction.
          Repository -> CourseDB: Read Course owner, status and revision
          activate CourseDB
          CourseDB -->> Repository: Current Course state
          ' Scope: Course ID, organizationId and chain.instructorId. Only Draft/Rejected are editable.
          ' lockedAt is not selected, checked or changed; Locked Draft/Rejected can still be updated.
          opt Non-null cover ID changed
            Repository -> CourseDB: Validate Ready CourseCover\nCurrent organization
            CourseDB -->> Repository: Valid cover ID
            ' Requires CourseCover purpose, Ready status and releasedAt=null; keep/remove skips this query.
          end
          Repository -> CourseDB: Replace seven Course fields\nOwner, status and updatedAt guards
          CourseDB -->> Repository: One Course updated
          ' updateMany checks current updatedAt plus tenant/chain owner and Draft/Rejected status.
          opt Course type changed
            Repository -> CourseDB: Insert CourseTypeChanged outbox row
            CourseDB -->> Repository: Outbox row stored
          end
          ' Commit Course update and optional outbox row atomically; no Kafka delivery is implied.
          deactivate CourseDB
          Repository -->> Service: Updated; courseTypeChanged flag
          deactivate Repository

          ' updateCourse calls findDetail after the transaction commits; this is not another HTTP request.
          Service -> Service: Reload updated Course details
          activate Service
          Service -> Repository: Load owned Course metadata
          activate Repository
          Repository -> CourseDB: Read updated Course and cover metadata
          activate CourseDB
          CourseDB -->> Repository: Updated Course metadata
          deactivate CourseDB
          Repository -->> Service: Updated Course
          deactivate Repository
          Service -> Service: Calculate estimated duration
          activate Service
          ' Same verified reading-speed/aggregate subcalls as the initial GET; not expanded here.
          deactivate Service
          opt Updated cover is Ready and not released
            Service -> Storage: Build cover URL
            activate Storage
            Storage -->> Service: Cover URL
            deactivate Storage
          end
          deactivate Service
          Service -->> Controller: Updated details and courseTypeChanged
          deactivate Service
          Controller -->> Gateway: 200 OK\nUpdated Course details
          deactivate Controller
          Gateway -->> Screen: Updated Course details
          deactivate Gateway
          Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Course updated successfully."
          Screen -> Screen: Return to Course Detail
          activate Screen
          deactivate Screen
        else Course update failed
          ' Restore incoming executions closed by the preceding operand.
          activate Gateway
          activate Controller
          activate Service
          ' 403: role/context; 400: field or INVALID_COVER; 404: missing/wrong tenant/wrong chain owner.
          ' NOT_EDITABLE (including Submitted) or a zero-row guarded update returns 409.
          ' Status may change after initial loading; the repository rechecks status inside the transaction.
          ' Technical 500 may roll back the transaction OR occur during post-commit findDetail.
          ' A committed update is not undone when its response readback fails.
          Service -->> Controller: Validation, access or update error
          deactivate Service
          Controller -->> Gateway: 400 / 403 / 404 / 409 / 500
          deactivate Controller
          Gateway -->> Screen: Update error
          deactivate Gateway
          Screen -->> Instructor: Show update error; keep edit page
        end
      else Cover preparation failed
        ' handleSave catches the upload error/missing response.data and never sends PUT.
        Screen -->> Instructor: Show cover upload error
      end
    else Form validation failed
      ' Ant Design errorFields are displayed inline; catch returns without a generic error toast.
      Screen -->> Instructor: Show form validation errors
    end
  else Edit status check failed
    ' This is the real UI branch for Submitted, Published, Archived and Disabled; no form or PUT.
    Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Course cannot be edited"\nOnly Draft or Rejected is editable
  end
else Course loading failed
  ' Restore the incoming load executions closed during the successful preparation path.
  activate Gateway
  activate Controller
  activate Service
  ' Role/context -> 403; missing Course/wrong tenant/wrong chain owner -> 404.
  ' Provider/DB errors are grouped as 500; rejected UUIDs are outside the valid-ID precondition.
  ' No successful metadata/duration read or image operation is assumed for these failed attempts.
  Service -->> Controller: Course access or loading error
  deactivate Service
  Controller -->> Gateway: 403 / 404 / 500
  deactivate Controller
  Gateway -->> Screen: Course loading error
  deactivate Gateway
  Screen -->> Instructor: Show "Course not found"\nOffer Back to My Courses
end
deactivate Screen
deactivate Instructor

' Seven PUT fields: name, shortDescription, trainingObjectives, learningOutcomes,
' expectedCompletionDays, courseType and nullable coverFileId. PUT replaces all seven.
' Empty name/outcome items fail on the server; UI trims and removes blank outcomes.
' UI-rejected image selections are ignored; other fields can still be saved with the retained cover.
' Backend image checks: nonempty buffer/name/MIME, positive size, <=5 MiB, JPEG/PNG/WebP.
' Multipart size rejection may be 413 before Service; upload access/validation/provider/DB errors are grouped.
' Gap BR-60/84: no Locked restriction, but only Draft/Rejected are allowed, even though specification
' permits descriptive edits more broadly outside Submitted. Published+Locked is NOT a success path.
' BR-285: UI blocks Submitted and backend rejects it as NOT_EDITABLE (409).
' BR-61: only Course fields/outbox are written; no Enrollment type, deadline or access is rewritten here.
' BR-60 notification/audit gap: CourseTypeChanged is persisted in outbox_events only.
' The inspected Course OutboxService/Controller are empty; no running publisher/notification/audit
' path is established by this code. The UI ignores courseTypeChanged; do not invent downstream delivery.
' Cover quota gap: uploadCover/createCourseCoverMediaFile do not fetch subscription policy or enforce
' organization storage quota. Quota logic in Video/Reading upload methods is not this cover flow.
' Cover upload and PUT are separate commits. PUT failure does not delete an already saved replacement.
' Replacing/removing the current cover does not delete/release its old MediaFile or storage object.
' Cleanup above applies only when new image upload succeeded but its metadata insert failed.
' BR-51: findDetail recomputes required Video/Reading minutes plus stored Assignment minutes.
' Reads latest local platform_settings reading speed; each Material is rounded up before summation.
' Missing/nonpositive reading speed -> null; Quiz is excluded; no Assignment REST occurs during PUT.
' BR-54/55 gap: edit UI and updateCourse do not compare duration against days/studyMinutesPerDay/
' durationGapThresholdPercent and show no duration warning. No warning or approval blocking is invented.
' TenantClient/LearningClient are injected but not called by load/update/upload/readback in this UC.
' Cloudinary upload/delete are real provider operations; getUrl is local SDK formatting only.
' Local credential presence selects CloudinaryStorageProvider, without verifying remote credentials.
' HTTP error interceptor resolves server envelopes; handleSave then throws Error from response.message
' or its fallback, so backend error.message may not reach the AxiosError-specific extraction branch.
' No Course creation, structure reorder, Material edit, approval submission, Kafka or cross-service REST.
@enduml
